<group prefix="WebGpuSharp.">
	<comment location="PopErrorScopeStatus">
		<summary>
			The status of the PopErrorScope function.
		</summary>
	</comment>
	<group prefix="PopErrorScopeStatus.">
		<comment location="Success">
			<summary>
				The error scope stack was successfully popped and a result was reported.
			</summary>
		</comment>
		<comment location="CallbackCancelled">
			<summary>
				This indicates that the callback was cancelled.
			</summary>
		</comment>
		<comment location="Error">
			<summary>
				The error scope stack could not be popped, because it was empty.		
			</summary>
		</comment>
    </group>
</group>